---
// DailyRitual.astro — How It Works timeline section
---

<section id="how-it-works" class="relative section-gap bg-stoa-surface">
  <div class="container-stoa text-center">
    <!-- Section Label -->
    <p class="inline-flex items-center gap-sm text-caption font-body font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-stoa-accent mb-xl">
      <span class="block w-4 h-px bg-stoa-accent"></span>
      How It Works
    </p>

    <!-- Title -->
    <h2 class="font-display font-normal text-title mb-lg">
      A rhythm your day<br />will thank you for.
    </h2>

    <!-- Subtitle -->
    <p class="font-body font-light text-[18px] leading-relaxed text-stoa-muted max-w-[480px] mx-auto mb-3xl">
      Stoa doesn't just hold your tasks — it shapes your day into three intentional moments.
    </p>

    <!-- Timeline -->
    <div class="relative max-w-[600px] mx-auto">
      <!-- Vertical line -->
      <div class="absolute left-[15px] md:left-1/2 md:-translate-x-px top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-stoa-border"></div>

      <!-- Step 1 — Morning Planning -->
      <div data-animate class="relative flex items-start gap-lg mb-3xl md:justify-start">
        <!-- Timeline dot -->
        <div class="relative z-10 flex-shrink-0 w-[30px] md:absolute md:left-1/2 md:-translate-x-1/2">
          <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-stoa-accent shadow-[0_0_12px_var(--color-accent-glow)]"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-left md:w-[calc(50%-32px)] md:mr-auto md:pr-lg">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-sm mb-xs">
            <span class="font-body font-medium text-caption uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-stoa-dim">7:00 – 9:00 AM</span>
            <kbd class="font-mono text-[11px] text-stoa-muted bg-stoa-surface2 border border-stoa-border-light rounded-sm px-1.5 py-0.5">&#8984; M</kbd>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-body font-medium text-[18px] text-stoa-text mb-xs">Morning Planning</h3>
          <h4 class="font-body font-light text-[15px] text-stoa-muted leading-relaxed mb-xs">Begin with intention</h4>
          <p class="font-body font-light text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-stoa-muted">
            Open Stoa. See yesterday's reflection. Choose your five for today from The Vault or create new ones. Close the app. Start working.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 — Focus Sessions -->
      <div data-animate class="relative flex items-start gap-lg mb-3xl md:justify-end">
        <!-- Timeline dot -->
        <div class="relative z-10 flex-shrink-0 w-[30px] md:absolute md:left-1/2 md:-translate-x-1/2">
          <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-stoa-accent shadow-[0_0_12px_var(--color-accent-glow)]"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-left md:w-[calc(50%-32px)] md:ml-auto md:pl-lg">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-sm mb-xs">
            <span class="font-body font-medium text-caption uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-stoa-dim">Throughout the day</span>
            <kbd class="font-mono text-[11px] text-stoa-muted bg-stoa-surface2 border border-stoa-border-light rounded-sm px-1.5 py-0.5">Enter</kbd>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-body font-medium text-[18px] text-stoa-text mb-xs">Focus Sessions</h3>
          <h4 class="font-body font-light text-[15px] text-stoa-muted leading-relaxed mb-xs">Go deep, one task at a time</h4>
          <p class="font-body font-light text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-stoa-muted">
            Whenever you're ready to work, activate Focus Mode. 25 minutes of presence. 5 minutes of rest. Repeat.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 — Evening Reflection -->
      <div data-animate class="relative flex items-start gap-lg md:justify-start">
        <!-- Timeline dot -->
        <div class="relative z-10 flex-shrink-0 w-[30px] md:absolute md:left-1/2 md:-translate-x-1/2">
          <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-stoa-accent shadow-[0_0_12px_var(--color-accent-glow)]"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-left md:w-[calc(50%-32px)] md:mr-auto md:pr-lg">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-sm mb-xs">
            <span class="font-body font-medium text-caption uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-stoa-dim">6:00 – 8:00 PM</span>
            <kbd class="font-mono text-[11px] text-stoa-muted bg-stoa-surface2 border border-stoa-border-light rounded-sm px-1.5 py-0.5">&#8984; .</kbd>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-body font-medium text-[18px] text-stoa-text mb-xs">Evening Reflection</h3>
          <h4 class="font-body font-light text-[15px] text-stoa-muted leading-relaxed mb-xs">Close the loop</h4>
          <p class="font-body font-light text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-stoa-muted">
            See what you accomplished. Answer one question about your day. Unfinished tasks move to The Vault — no judgment, just tomorrow.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
